  transfer: '<p>Each day this week, read one news article and rewrite its main claim with appropriate hedging (e.g., “The study suggests…”). Collect 10 collocations from real texts in your vocabulary deck. Next time you give feedback (at work or to a friend), try the diplomatic formula: positive + area to improve + suggestion.</p>',
